<title>USA: United Wisconsin Services completes merger.</title>
<headline>United Wisconsin Services completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Wisconsin Services Inc said Tuesday it has completed its merger with  American Medical Security Group Inc.</p>
<p>United Wisconsin said substantially all of the business formerly conducted by AMS will be operated by American Security Holdings Inc, a wholly owned subsidiary of United Wisconsin.</p>
<p>United Wisconsin paid $67 million in cash and nearly 3.7 million newly issued shares for AMS.</p>
<p>United Wisconsin is a managed healthcare company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
